WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
The Internet is like a breeding ground for conspiracy theories.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.648
While some are juste stupid and funny, others

00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:09.209
promote ignorance and an unhealthy distrust.

00:00:09.514 --> 00:00:14.074
So we went to the Kurzgesagt lab and developed a foolproof system

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.300
to destroy not all but a lot of

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.340
conspiracy theories. It's really simple, just ask yourself:

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.560
Does the theory affect really rich and powerful people?

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:28.360
Is the answer yes? OK, then it's most likely... Not true.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.760
Let's test it on three examples.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:40.675
Number one: There is an easy cure for cancer but it's withheld because

00:00:40.675 --> 00:00:42.654
it would destroy the profits of pharma companies.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:48.260
Hmmm... Do really rich people die of cancer, like, I don't know, say

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.600
the former CEO of Apple? Yes?

00:00:52.274 --> 00:00:54.834
There is no suppressed cure for cancer.

00:00:55.310 --> 00:01:00.750
Number two: Chemtrails, the theory that airplanes spray chimicals in the air for

00:01:00.988 --> 00:01:04.108
population control or some of the crazy reason.

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:10.080
Do really powerful people breathe air? Do Obama or Putin breathe air? Yes?

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.854
Chemtrails are not a thing.

00:01:12.854 --> 00:01:15.756
Number three: Apocalyptic conspiracy theories.

00:01:16.352 --> 00:01:20.032
The world will end soon because of the Antichrist, Mayas

00:01:20.032 --> 00:01:24.552
Aliens, someone says so. Do really rich and powerful people ignore the

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:28.100
soon to be upon us and a very imminent apocalypse? Yes?

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.840
The world will not end soon.

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.440
This obviously doesn't works for every conspiracy theory out there

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:38.200
But it does works for some of the most stupid ones. So the next time someone tries to

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.300
convince you that the Illuminati put stuff in you water, just show him this video

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:46.880
and maybe be a bit more selective about your friends on Facebook.

